---
// Quiz figure for the color post, Uxq05: three blues picked by hand for hover, confirm and link.
---
<div class="qfig-uxq05hexdrift">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 170" role="img" aria-label="Three nearly identical blue buttons with hex codes #2B62B8, #2E66BF and #346CC4.">
<text x="105" y="24" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hover state</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trạng thái hover</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="36" width="170" height="56" rx="8" fill="#2B62B8" />
<text x="105" y="70" class="w" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hover</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hover</tspan></text>
<text x="105" y="118" class="m" text-anchor="middle">#2B62B8</text>
<text x="300" y="24" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Confirm button</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nút xác nhận</tspan></text>
<rect x="215" y="36" width="170" height="56" rx="8" fill="#2E66BF" />
<text x="300" y="70" class="w" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Confirm</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xác nhận</tspan></text>
<text x="300" y="118" class="m" text-anchor="middle">#2E66BF</text>
<text x="495" y="24" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Link</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đường link</tspan></text>
<rect x="410" y="36" width="170" height="56" rx="8" fill="#346CC4" />
<text x="495" y="70" class="w" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Read more</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xem thêm</tspan></text>
<text x="495" y="118" class="m" text-anchor="middle">#346CC4</text>
<text x="300" y="152" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Three values picked by hand, one week apart</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ba giá trị chọn tay, cách nhau một tuần</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-uxq05hexdrift { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-uxq05hexdrift svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-uxq05hexdrift text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-uxq05hexdrift .h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq05hexdrift .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .qfig-uxq05hexdrift .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq05hexdrift .w { fill: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
</style>
